Lineup Desktop: do not build the GPL-licensed aarch64 CRC assembly.

libavutil/aarch64/crc.S carries a GPL-2.0+ header (in FFmpeg 9.1). The build also passes --disable-arm-crc --disable-pmull
--disable-eor3, so libavutil/aarch64/crc.h (LGPL) never references it and
libavutil uses its portable C CRC code.

--- a/libavutil/aarch64/Makefile
+++ b/libavutil/aarch64/Makefile
@@ -3,7 +3,6 @@
         aarch64/float_dsp_init.o                                      \
         aarch64/tx_float_init.o                                       \
 
-ARMV8-OBJS += aarch64/crc.o
 
 NEON-OBJS += aarch64/aes.o                                            \
              aarch64/base64.o                                         \
